                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da7508f0-ddd7-4dd5-9cb1-0596dbb6a574",
                                "sense_id": "a4bd152f-8611-315a-b38e-ff88c9c7c0aa",
                                "text": "It is curious at least, that his Philosophy obliged Pythagoras, to make the Solar System #61;10, tho' his imperfect Astrognosy reduced him to the shift of including the moon, and imagining an Antiχθων [\"anti-earth, anti-world\"] and taking the whole as a completory Unit—Sun, Mer[cury,] Ven[us,] Earth, Moon, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Antichthon #61;9#43; Solar Syst[em] #61;1#61;10"
                            }
                        ]
